1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,480
In 1920,

2
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:02,320
one man promised

3
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:03,100
to grow your money

4
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:04,080
by 50%

5
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:05,780
in 45 days.

6
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:06,820
Charles Ponzi said

7
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:07,260
he was trading

8
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:09,480
international postal coupons.

9
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,600
He wasn't.

10
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:11,660
He paid early investors

11
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:12,500
with money from

12
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:13,260
new ones,

13
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:13,620
and the crowds

14
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:14,880
kept coming.

15
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:16,260
When reporters checked,

16
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:17,080
there weren't enough coupons

17
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:17,880
in the world

18
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:18,900
to cover it.

19
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:19,600
The scheme collapsed

20
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:20,320
in August,

21
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:21,340
and it still carries

22
00:00:21,340 --> 00:00:22,310
his name.
